  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Introduced Controller and DirectiveController for structured client-side orchestration.\n- Added Remote module with configurable reliable and unreliable communication clients.\n- Implemented TimeSyncExtensions for clock alignment between client and server.\n- Added L10N subsystem with Localization, Localizer, and MultiLocalizer support.\n- Improved configuration and extension APIs for SDK customization.\n- Enhanced dependency structure for modular SDK integration.\n- General cleanup, documentation updates, and performance tuning.",
